  m_text: "In this thrilling journey, you control a daring bird soaring through an
    ever-changing path of pipes. But these aren\u2019t ordinary obstacles\u2014each
    set of pipes is connected to a unique aim board system. With the right shot,
    you can hit the target and instantly shift the pipes\u2014sending one upward
    and the other downward\u2014opening new paths and saving yourself from certain
    collision."
